@node Top
@top Casual Suite User Guide

Version: 2.0.1

Copyright © 2026 @w{Charles Y. Choi}

Casual Suite is an umbrella package to support a single installation point for all Casual user interfaces for Emacs. This is accomplished by including child packages as dependencies via the Elisp library header @code{Package-Requires} (@ref{Library Headers,elisp#Library Headers,,elisp,})

The organization of Casual Suite is as follows:

@itemize
@item
Casual Suite — Umbrella package

@itemize
@item
Casual (@ref{Top,,,casual,}) — Library of interfaces for built-in Emacs modes.

@item
Casual Avy (@ref{Top,,,casual-avy,}) — Interface for Avy (third party)

@item
Casual Symbol Overlay (@ref{Top,,,casual-symbol-overlay,}) — Interface for Symbol Overlay (third party)
@end itemize
@end itemize


If you enjoy using Casual Suite@comma{} please consider buying me a coffee to help support its development and maintenance.

